WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Just Speak to It for Linux, in beta. Sample data: fictional History and fixed test text.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:05.533
A native GTK 4 app with the same dashboard

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:08.533
